# Normalize line endings: text files get CRLF in the working copy on
# Windows but are stored as LF in the repo — kills the "LF will be
# replaced by CRLF" warning spam and whole-file diffs.
# Keep common binary files away from the text=auto heuristic to prevent
# corruption (embedded images, fonts, archives, native libs).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
* text=auto
*.cs text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.css text
*.html text
*.sql text
*.mmd text
*.drawio text
Dockerfile text
*.dockerignore text
.gitignore text
